94:Delivery contract: mode=no-mistakes forge=gitlab
129:After /no-mistakes reports CI green (the CI-ready return point - do not wait for it to keep monitoring in the background until merge), read the PR back from the forge and confirm it is not a draft (`glab-axi mr view <iid> --full` must print `draft: no`, where <iid> is the merge request number from your MR URL); if it is a draft, mark it ready with `glab-axi mr update <iid> --ready`.
130:A draft cannot be merged, so a done report on one leaves the merge unasked.
133:If you deliberately keep the PR a draft, append `paused [at=<epoch>]: {why the draft is held}` instead of done.

